// Scene templates (DEC-035, DEC-079): a short exchange with a character at a
// place. Scenes happen somewhere, but nothing critical is only there: the
// pocket lists every pending decision with its options. Going to the place
// adds the conversation, where the speaker may quote what they remember of
// the player (`quote_fallback` is used when they remember nothing).
// Places: `workplace` (where a cast person works, else `fallback`) or `kind`.
// `teaches` (DEC-091): what answering the decision teaches, with the
// dilemma's roles (see the SubjectDef schema; a neighbourhood without a role
// is where the scene happens). The cast people are met (`known`) anyway.
